    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49735" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰα-τήρ</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Cypr.
		</span></i> acc. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ</span>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>j</i>a
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Cypr.</u>
					135.3
				</span></i>
			 H., 
				Ep.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰητήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>, ὁ, poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰατρός</span>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> mostly, <i>surgeon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.732
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.384
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.65
			</span></i>, etc.: generally, <i>healer</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1209
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένθεος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.466.8
				</span></i>
			(<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>): abs., <i>deliverer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.270
			</span></i>.</div>
